# timesink apps.conf: friendly names and categories.
# Copy to ~/.config/timesink/apps.conf and edit.
#
#   raw class (what the desktop reports)   display name   category
#
# - Run `timesink-daemon apps` to list every app seen so far; lines
#   marked "not in apps.conf" still need an entry.
# - A raw class ending in * matches everything that starts with it.
# - Matching ignores upper/lower case. The category may contain spaces.
# - Names are applied only when shown; the database keeps the raw class,
#   so editing this file re-sorts your whole history.

org.wezfurlong.wezterm      wezterm      Terminal
zen                         zen          Browser
eu.betterbird.Betterbird    betterbird   Email
md.obsidian.Obsidian        obsidian     Notes
discord                     discord      Chat
hexchat                     hexchat      Chat
cider                       cider        Music
io.github.lgse.Strata*      strata       Files
org.gnome.Nautilus          nautilus     Files
jetbrains-studio            android-studio  Development
bitwarden                   bitwarden    Passwords
com.gabm.satty           satty        Utilities
